Local build adaptation: aec3-portable-vector-access.patch replaces compiler-
specific register subscripting with equivalent load/store intrinsics in the
x86 matched filter. The verified upstream checkout remains unchanged; the
patch is applied to a build-tree copy. Windows compiler options, SDK macros,
exports and multimedia linkage are declared by the wrapper build.

